{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"十有五年春二月，天王使家父來求車。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"三月乙未，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"夏四月己巳，葬齊僖公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"五月，鄭伯突出奔蔡。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"鄭世子忽復歸于鄭。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"許叔入于許。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"公會齊侯于艾。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"邾人、牟人、葛人來朝。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"秋九月，鄭伯突入于櫟。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"冬十有一月，公會宋公、衛侯、陳侯于袲，伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"十五年春，天王使家父來求車，非禮也。諸侯不貢車、服，天子不私求財。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"祭仲專，鄭伯患之，使其壻雍糾殺之。將享諸郊。雍姬知之，謂其母曰：「父與夫孰親？」其母曰：「人盡夫也，父一而已，胡可比也？」遂告祭仲曰：「雍氏舍其室而將享子於郊，吾惑之，以告。」祭仲殺雍糾，尸諸周氏之汪。公載以出，曰：「謀及婦人，宜其死也。」夏，厲公出奔蔡。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"六月乙亥，昭公入。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"許叔入于許。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"公會齊侯于艾，謀定許也。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_18","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"秋，鄭伯因櫟人殺檀伯，而遂居櫟。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_ttr_26_19","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_26","textTraditional":"冬，會于袲，謀伐鄭，將納厲公也。弗克而還。","sentenceOrder":19}],"overrides":{}}